1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,218
There is one phrase you will hear more than any other.

2
00:00:02,334 --> 00:00:07,593
The first thing Jesus preaches in this book is this: Repent, for the kingdom of heaven is near.

3
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:11,250
That phrase, the kingdom of heaven, appears thirty-two times in Matthew.

4
00:00:11,632 --> 00:00:16,579
It is his way of naming God&#8217;s reign, and in this book that reign arrives in a person.

